"""
Q1

Ek line input lo jisme 2 ya zyada words hon.

Us line me:

- total number of words print karo
- longest word print karo
- shortest word print karo

Conditions:

- "split()" use karna hai
- "max()" aur "min()" direct use nahi karne
- loop aur "len()" use karna hai

Example Input

I am learning Python fast

Expected Output

5
learning
I

---


#Q1

text_line = input("Enter a text line: ").split()

l = len(text_line)

longest = text_line[0]
shortest = text_line[0]

print("Total words =", l)

for i in range(l):
    if len(text_line[i]) > len(longest):
        longest = text_line[i]

    if len(text_line[i]) < len(shortest):
        shortest = text_line[i]

print("Longest =", longest)
print("Shortest =", shortest)


